        {
          "path": ".build/renewal-discovery/account-enrollment-step/final-sources/Modules/Services/SelfRenewal/SelfRenewalDeveloperAccountClient.swift",
          "line": 444
        }
      ],
      "assessment": "Busy is held across all asynchronous connect/observe/refresh/finalize operations; signOut refuses busy and invalidates local use before a possibly failing storage write. Remote expiry/account/team changes during reuse invalidate future local credentials, retaining session plus storage errors when invalidation fails. An attempted different candidate at connect rejects overwrite while leaving an existing prior candidate unchanged; it does not authorize that new account."
    },
    {
      "concern": "Unknown remote effects and duplicate issuance",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "path": ".build/renewal-discovery/account-enrollment-step/final-sources/Modules/Services/SelfRenewal/SelfRenewalDeveloperAccountClient.swift",
          "line": 222
        },
        {
