        {
          "path": ".build/renewal-discovery/account-enrollment-step/final-sources/Modules/Services/SelfRenewal/SelfRenewalDeveloperAccountClient.swift",
          "line": 211
        }
      ],
      "assessment": "A same-record durable intent is saved before possible certificate dispatch; certificate observation is saved before profile requests. Cancellation/lost ACK/malformed response never automatically clears it. A reopened client cannot issue another refresh while pending exists. The conservative flags are may-have-happened facts, not ACKs. Profile history is not individually reconciled; current pending blocking is conservative and the missing reconciliation path stays unfinished."
    },
    {
      "concern": "Real CSR/private key and final Vault publication",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "path": ".build/renewal-discovery/account-enrollment-step/final-sources/Modules/Services/SelfRenewal/SelfRenewalDeveloperAccountClient.swift",
          "line": 216
        },
