          "line": 71
        },
        {
          "path": ".build/renewal-discovery/account-enrollment-step/final-sources/Modules/Services/SelfRenewal/SelfRenewalDeveloperAccountTransport.swift",
          "line": 76
        }
      ],
      "assessment": "One reused ephemeral URLSession has no shared cookies, URL credentials or cache. Actual request origin/method/prefix are constrained, redirects are refused and non-server-trust challenges rejected. Server trust uses normal system validation. Response expected and actual bytes are bounded; every byte iteration checks cancellation and the actual response task is cancelled on exit. Transport exceptions become fixed typed codes; no private remote messages/headers are logged. Per-request/resource deadlines are real configuration, but an uncooperative injected anisette provider has no added hard bound."
