    "assessment": "The peer actor records only the first actual CSR-arrived or actual refresh-task-finished event. Both success and error notify completion. Early completion reads the original task.value, preserving the actual error; CSR arrival keeps the original cancel/assertions. Its waiting-task cancellation handler cancels the actual refresh task. No synthetic CSR result, timing wait or additional behavior method was added.",
